    {
      "id": "c-nanshi-016-wangxuanxiang:received_sentence1-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "94x_2iu_gsm",
      "source_quote": "玄謨從弟玄象，位下邳太守。",
      "reading": "玄象為玄謨從弟，任下邳太守。",
      "note": "玄象為玄謨從弟，任下邳太守。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-016-wangxuanxiang:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 13,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanshi-016-wangxuanxiang:received_sentence1-13",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "94x_2iu_gsm",
      "source_quote": "好發塚，地無完槨。",
      "reading": "敘玄象好發塚。",
      "note": "敘玄象好發塚。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-016-wangxuanxiang:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 13,
      "end_codepoint": 22,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanshi-016-wangxuanxiang:received_sentence1-22",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "94x_2iu_gsm",
      "source_quote": "人間垣内有小塚，墳上殆平，毎朝日初升，見一女子立塚上，近視則亡。",
      "reading": "城垣小塚初升見女子，近視則亡，是傳聞敘事。",
      "note": "城垣小塚初升見女子，近視則亡，是傳聞敘事。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-016-wangxuanxiang:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 22,
      "end_codepoint": 54,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanshi-016-wangxuanxiang:received_sentence1-54",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "94x_2iu_gsm",
      "source_quote": "或以告玄象，便命發之。",
      "reading": "無名告事者報玄象，玄象命發之。",
      "note": "無名告事者報玄象，玄象命發之。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-016-wangxuanxiang:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 54,
      "end_codepoint": 65,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanshi-016-wangxuanxiang:received_sentence1-65",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "94x_2iu_gsm",
      "source_quote": "有一棺尚全，有金蠶、銅人以百數。",
      "reading": "金蠶、銅人以百數，是物數。",
      "note": "金蠶、銅人以百數，是物數。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-016-wangxuanxiang:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 65,
      "end_codepoint": 81,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanshi-016-wangxuanxiang:received_sentence1-81",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "94x_2iu_gsm",
      "source_quote": "剖棺見一女子，年可二十，姿質若生，臥而言曰：「我東海王家女，應生，資財相奉，幸勿見害。」",
      "reading": "棺中女子外貌可二十，自稱東海王家女，未具父名。",
      "note": "棺中女子外貌可二十，自稱東海王家女，未具父名。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-016-wangxuanxiang:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 81,
      "end_codepoint": 125,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanshi-016-wangxuanxiang:received_sentence1-125",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "94x_2iu_gsm",
      "source_quote": "女臂有玉釧，破塚者斬臂取之，於是女復死。",
      "reading": "破塚者取玉釧，敘女復死。",
      "note": "破塚者取玉釧，敘女復死。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-016-wangxuanxiang:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 125,
      "end_codepoint": 145,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanshi-016-wangxuanxiang:received_sentence1-145",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "94x_2iu_gsm",
      "source_quote": "玄謨時爲徐州刺史，以事上聞，玄象坐免郡。",
      "reading": "玄謨時為徐州刺史，上報，玄象免郡。",
      "note": "玄謨時為徐州刺史，上報，玄象免郡。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-016-wangxuanxiang:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 145,
      "end_codepoint": 165,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-taipingyulan-558-wangxuanxiang:received_sentence1-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "94x_2iu_gsm",
      "source_quote": "《宋書》曰：王玄謨從弟玄象，位下邳太守。",
      "reading": "《御覽》明標宋書，玄謨從弟玄象任下邳。",
      "note": "《御覽》明標宋書，玄謨從弟玄象任下邳。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-taipingyulan-558-wangxuanxiang:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 20,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-taipingyulan-558-wangxuanxiang:received_sentence1-20",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "94x_2iu_gsm",
      "source_quote": "好發冢，地無完椁。",
      "reading": "敘玄象好發冢。",
      "note": "敘玄象好發冢。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-taipingyulan-558-wangxuanxiang:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 20,
      "end_codepoint": 29,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-taipingyulan-558-wangxuanxiang:received_sentence1-29",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "94x_2iu_gsm",
      "source_quote": "時人間垣內有小冢，墳上殆平。",
